    "custom_collapsible_content_jx9WzK": {
      "type": "custom-collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_rXjh7Y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you have a catalogue?",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our beautiful deVOL accessories can all be viewed on our <a href=\"/pages/shop\" title=\"Our Shop\">online shop</a>, or if you'd like more inspiration, you can order our brochure where you'll find all our favourite projects and learn a little bit about everything we do here at deVOL. <a href=\"/products/devol-brochure\" title=\"The deVOL Brochure - Spring 2026\">Request a free copy here</a>. You can also see online catalogues of our modular furniture collections via the links below: </p><p><a href=\"/pages/shaker-kitchen-base-cabinets\" title=\"Shaker Base Cabinets\">The Shaker Catalogue</a></p><p><a href=\"/pages/sebastian-cox-base-cabinets\" title=\"Sebastian Cox Base Cabinets\">The Sebastian Cox Catalogue</a></p><p><a href=\"/pages/haberdashers-base-cabinets\" title=\"Haberdasher's Base Cabinets\">The Haberdasher's Catalogue</a></p>",
            "url_title": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_67URJU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much does a deVOL Kitchen cost?",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The average cost of a deVOL Kitchen is as follows:</p><p>Avg. Shaker Kitchen - $35,000</p><p>Avg. Classic Kitchen - $60,000</p><p>Avg. Sebastian Cox Kitchen - $35,000</p><p>Avg. Haberdasher’s Kitchen - $50,000</p><p>It’s important to recognise that these costs exclude worktops and delivery.</p>",
            "url_title": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jfqzme": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are shop items available to see in your showrooms?",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we have lots of our home accessories dotted throughout our showrooms. However, we cannot guarantee that every item is available to see in every showroom.</p><p>Please call ahead of your visit if there is a particular item that you'd like to see and we'll do our best to get one ready for you.</p>",
            "url_title": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_dGWzjk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I make an account on your website?",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Not at the moment, we will send all of your order information, including dispatch notifications and returns updates, directly to the email you provide.</p>",
            "url_title": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_a3dnXg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I subscribe to a deVOL newsletter?",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! You can sign up to receive interiors inspiration and occasional updates from deVOL <a href=\"/pages/thanks\" title=\"Letters from deVOL\">here</a>.</p>",
            "url_title": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_J4H4yh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I unsubscribe from your emails?",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Every email sent to you will have an option to unsubscribe at the bottom of the email. We'd love to hear from you if you have any feedback about the things we send to you.</p>",
            "url_title": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Xh7T7e": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use your images on my blog or website?",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Please contact our PR & Marketing team for further information about using our images.</p><p><a href=\"mailto:pr@devolkitchens.co.uk\">pr@devolkitchens.co.uk</a></p>",
